---
const faqs = [
  {
    question:
      "How do I know what type of website my business needs?",
    answer:
      "That depends on what visitors need to accomplish. A business website, ecommerce platform, booking system, landing page and custom web application solve different problems, so we begin with the business requirement rather than a fixed package.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Will the website work properly on mobile devices?",
    answer:
      "Yes. Responsive behaviour is part of the development process rather than a separate optional feature.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Do you consider SEO while developing the website?",
    answer:
      "Yes. Technical structure, metadata, semantics, internal links, performance and crawlability should be considered during development. Ongoing SEO strategy remains a separate broader discipline.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Can LKProfessionals redesign an existing website?",
    answer:
      "Yes. Existing websites can be reviewed and rebuilt where design, structure, performance, maintainability or conversion effectiveness need improvement.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Can the website connect to external systems?",
    answer:
      "Yes, where appropriate integration methods are available. Websites and web applications can connect to payment providers, CRMs, messaging services, booking systems, APIs and other business platforms.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "What happens after the website launches?",
    answer:
      "A production website still requires updates, monitoring, technical maintenance and periodic improvement as the business and web ecosystem change.",
  },
];
---

<section class="web-faq">
  <div class="site-container web-faq__layout">
    <div>
      <p>Web development FAQ</p>

      <h2>
        Questions before turning the brief into pages.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="web-faq__list">
      {
        faqs.map((faq) => (
          <details>
            <summary>{faq.question}</summary>
            <p>{faq.answer}</p>
          </details>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .web-faq {
    padding-block: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem);
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .web-faq__layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns:
      minmax(16rem, 0.68fr)
      minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 8rem);
  }

  .web-faq__layout
    > div:first-child > p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: #0b2f8f;
    font-size: 0.64rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .web-faq h2 {
    max-width: 11ch;
    margin: 0;
    color: #0d203c;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.6rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .web-faq__list {
    border-top: 1px solid #dce3ec;
  }

  .web-faq details {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #dce3ec;
    padding-block: 1rem;
  }

  .web-faq summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    color: #293b53;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 740;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .web-faq details p {
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    color: #788497;
    font-size: 0.69rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 52rem) {
    .web-faq__layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
